IMPORTANT — emulation engines

If a Press Start build links DeltaCore or the GBC / GBA / NES / SNES /
GPGX (or other) AGPL-licensed cores, those components remain under the
GNU Affero General Public License v3.0. Their copyright holders’ terms are
not overridden by this proprietary notice. Distributing a combined work that
includes those AGPL components requires AGPL compliance (including offering
corresponding source for the combined work as AGPL requires).

To ship a fully closed-source App Store build with no AGPL obligations,
Press Start must not link AGPL cores — use a differently licensed engine or
obtain a commercial license from each core’s copyright holders.

Third-party notices: see the in-app Licenses screen and Vendor/README.md.
